				<div class="reveal-up panel-soft rounded-[24px] border border-white/70 p-5 text-center shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/60">
					<div class="icon-badge mx-auto mb-3 h-12 w-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-violet-600 text-lg font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25">١</div>
					<h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-800">تواصل معنا</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">راسلنا لاختيار الباقة المناسبة والحصول على كود التفعيل.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="reveal-up panel-soft rounded-[24px] border border-white/70 p-5 text-center shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/60">
					<div class="icon-badge mx-auto mb-3 h-12 w-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-violet-600 text-lg font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25">٢</div>
					<h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-800">أنشئ حسابك</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">سجّل بيانات عيادتك وفعّل حسابك بكود التفعيل خلال دقيقة.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="reveal-up panel-soft rounded-[24px] border border-white/70 p-5 text-center shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/60">
